iation":["이사"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去世","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"人死。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c6fc3ead1d5764cdf813.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75001-1-5-2","ko":"네. 아버지 정년퇴직 이후에 조용한 동네에서 사시겠다며 이사를 가셨답니다.","zh":"是的。据说父亲退休后想住在安静的社区，所以才搬过去的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"아버지","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}},{"text":"정년퇴직","meaning":"退休","explanation":"정년퇴직：退休","readings":[{"term":"정년퇴직","audio":"/audio/56233379d3ac607e1c9e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75001","senseId":"1","lemma":"정년퇴직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정년퇴직","audio":"/audio/56233379d3ac607e1c9e.mp3"}},{"text":"이후에","meaning":"以后","explanation":"이후：以后；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이후","audio":"/audio/ee1d8655d66d382b52a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70757","senseId":"2","lemma":"이후","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이후에","audio":"/audio/7d1be9f4dd456951d467.mp3"}},{"text":"조용한","meaning":"安静","explanation":"조용하다：安静；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"조용하다","audio":"/audio/1cd9dc985df28c4908a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58167","senseId":"1","lemma":"조용하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조용한","audio":"/audio/dae68153c8b9f3c9d96e.mp3"}},{"text":"동네에서","meaning":"小区，社区，村庄","explanation":"